    "html": "<div style=\"--color-aubergine-ink:#2a222b;--color-deep-plum:#3e3040;--color-violet-mist:#9454ab;--color-lavender-whisper:#ddb7f0;--color-cream-canvas:#faf9fb;--color-pure-white:#ffffff;--color-charcoal:#222222;--color-slate-mid:#564b58;--color-ash:#655d67;--color-fog:#837a85;--color-mist:#d4d1d5;--color-parchment:#f5f3f6;--font-tobias:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;--font-twk-lausanne:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;width:600px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-twk-lausanne);\"><div style=\"background:var(--color-aubergine-ink);padding:14px 48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;min-height:48px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:var(--font-twk-lausanne);font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-cream-canvas);line-height:1.4;text-align:center;font-feature-settings:'clig','liga','ss01','ss11';\">Don't just collect leads\u2014close them.&nbsp;<a href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--color-cream-canvas);text-decoration:underline;font-family:var(--font-twk-lausanne);font-size:15px;font-weight:400;\">Learn more about Typeform for Growth.</a></p><button style=\"position:absolute;right:20px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 4L4 12M4 4L12 12\" stroke=\"#faf9fb\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
