  {
    "html": "<div style=\"--color-aubergine-ink:#2a222b;--color-deep-plum:#3e3040;--color-violet-mist:#9454ab;--color-lavender-whisper:#ddb7f0;--color-cream-canvas:#faf9fb;--color-pure-white:#ffffff;--color-charcoal:#222222;--color-slate-mid:#564b58;--color-ash:#655d67;--color-fog:#837a85;--color-mist:#d4d1d5;--color-parchment:#f5f3f6;--font-tobias:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;--font-twk-lausanne:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;width:600px;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-twk-lausanne);background:var(--color-cream-canvas);padding:56px 48px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:32px;align-items:flex-start;\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:var(--font-twk-lausanne);font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-violet-mist);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;font-feature-settings:'clig','liga','ss01','ss11';\">Data Collection</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:var(--font-tobias);font-size:40px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-aubergine-ink);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-1.2px;font-feature-settings:'clig','liga','ss01','ss11';\">Get 3.5x more data with a form expert</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 32px 0;font-family:var(--font-twk-lausanne);font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-ash);line-height:1.49;font-feature-settings:'clig','liga','ss01','ss11';\">Backed by over a decade of experience, Typeform AI helps you build expertly-designed, best-practice forms proven to get more responses.</p><a href=\"#\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:var(--color-aubergine-ink);color:var(--color-cream-canvas);font-family:var(--font-twk-lausanne);font-size:16px;font-weight:400;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-feature-settings:'clig','liga','ss01','ss11';\">Get started\u2014it's free</a></div><div style=\"width:180px;flex-shrink:0;\"><div style=\"width:180px;height:220px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f0eaf8,#e8dff4);border-radius:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"width:130px;\"><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"height:6px;background:#c8b8d8;border-radius:3px;width:80%;margin-bottom:5px;\"></div><div style=\"height:6px;background:#c8b8d8;border-radius:3px;width:55%;\"></div></div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"height:6px;background:#d4c5e2;border-radius:3px;width:90%;margin-bottom:5px;\"></div><div style=\"height:6px;background:#d4c5e2;border-radius:3px;width:65%;\"></div></div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;\"><div style=\"height:6px;background:#ddd0ea;border-radius:3px;width:70%;\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
